  "problem": "In business, the economic profit is defined as\n\n$$\nE=PQ-C,\n$$\n\nwhere $P$ is the sale price of a good, $Q$ is the number of goods sold, and $C$ is the cost of producing $Q$ goods. \n\nWhat is the formula for the price in terms of the other variables?",
